  "dcterms:title": "PurificationDB: database of purification conditions for proteins",
  "dcterms:description": "PurificationDB is an open-access knowledge base of 4732 curated and standardized entries of protein purification conditions (buffers, additives, and conditions) extracted from the literature using named-entity recognition, cross-referenced to the Protein Data Bank and UniProt. It was published by Garland, Radaeva, Pandey, Cherkasov, and Lallous in Database: The Journal of Biological Databases and Curation (Oxford University Press, 2023; DOI 10.1093/database/baad016) and served from the deployed app at purificationdatabase.herokuapp.com. This brick materializes those purification-condition entries as parquet.",
